          <div class="hidden sm:flex sm:col-span-3 justify-end items-center gap-1.5 text-tgreen text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-mono">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-tgreen"></span> Running
          </div>
        </div>

        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-2 px-4 sm:px-6 py-4 border-b border-slate-dark/50 items-center">
          <div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-5">
            <div class="text-white text-sm font-bold">Writing / editing</div>
            <div class="text-slate text-[11px] sm:text-xs">Draft + revise the design doc</div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-span-7 sm:col-span-4">
            <code class="text-cyber font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm">codex</code>
            <span class="text-slate-dark text-[10px] sm:text-xs ml-2">harness: cli</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hidden sm:flex sm:col-span-3 justify-end items-center gap-1.5 text-warn text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-mono">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-warn"></span> Working
          </div>
        </div>

        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-12 gap-2 px-4 sm:px-6 py-4 items-center">
          <div class="col-span-12 sm:col-span-5">
            <div class="text-white text-sm font-bold">Other workflows</div>
            <div class="text-slate text-[11px] sm:text-xs">Custom / shell-driven task</div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-span-7 sm:col-span-4">
            <code class="text-cyber font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm">pi</code>
            <span class="text-slate-dark text-[10px] sm:text-xs ml-2">harness: cli</span>
          </div>
          <div class="hidden sm:flex sm:col-span-3 justify-end items-center gap-1.5 text-cyber text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-mono">
            <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-cyber"></span> Idle
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="text-center mt-3 text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-mono text-slate-dark">
        Illustrative — your task-fit combinations are chosen by you, not NightMe.
      </div>
    </div>

    
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto mb-10">
      <div class="bg-terminal border border-slate-dark rounded-xl p-6">
        <div class="text-cyber font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold mb-2 uppercase tracking-wider">Task-fit execution environments</div>
        <p class="text-slate text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Choose the Agent + Harness combination that gives you the most effective environment for the task instead of forcing every task through one tool.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-terminal border border-slate-dark rounded-xl p-6">
        <div class="text-cyber font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold mb-2 uppercase tracking-wider">Same workflow, many tasks</div>
        <p class="text-slate text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Different conversations can represent different projects, tasks, and agent sessions at the same time—each with its own working directory.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center text-cyber text-sm sm:text-base font-mono">
      Different tasks. Different agents. One consistent workflow.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>


<section id="control" class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-[#0D1017] border-b border-slate-dark">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="text-center mb-10 sm:mb-14">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-terminal border border-slate-dark text-xs font-mono text-cyber mb-4 uppercase tracking-wider">
        Human in the loop
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
        Let it run. Know when it needs you.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate max-w-3xl mx-auto text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        NightMe keeps you informed while your agent works. Status updates and reaction signals tell you what is happening, so you don't have to keep checking in or babysit the agent.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 max-w-5xl mx-auto mb-10">
      <div class="bg-terminal border border-slate-dark rounded-xl p-6">
        <div class="text-cyber font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">Statusbar</div>
        <p class="text-slate text-sm leading-relaxed">
          See the session's current state without asking for an update.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-terminal border border-slate-dark rounded-xl p-6">
        <div class="text-cyber font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">Reaction signals</div>
        <p class="text-slate text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Get clear feedback from the agent as it works, so you know when it is running, waiting, or finished.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-terminal border border-slate-dark rounded-xl p-6">
        <div class="text-cyber font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">Step in</div>
        <p class="text-slate text-sm leading-relaxed">
          <code class="text-cyber font-mono text-xs bg-night px-1 rounded">/stop</code> &middot;
          <code class="text-cyber font-mono text-xs bg-night px-1 rounded">/steer</code>
          &mdash; change direction when you need to, then let the agent continue.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center text-slate text-sm sm:text-base italic leading-relaxed">
      The agent keeps working. NightMe keeps you informed. You step in when it matters.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>


<section id="gtw" class="py-16 sm:py-24 border-t border-slate-dark relative overflow-hidden bg-[#0D1017]">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[linear-gradient(to_right,#3E505A_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(to_bottom,#3E505A_1px,transparent_1px)] bg-[size:4rem_4rem] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_60%_50%_at_50%_0%,#000_70%,transparent_100%)] opacity-[0.05]"></div>

  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 relative z-10 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 sm:gap-16 items-center">
    <div>
      <div class="text-tgreen font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-sm font-bold mb-2 sm:mb-3 uppercase tracking-wider">Git Team Workflow</div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4 sm:mb-6">
        From conversation to pull request.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate text-sm sm:text-base mb-8 leading-relaxed">
        When the work needs to become a clean Git change, <code>/gtw</code> connects coding agents with worktrees and pull requests—so parallel fixes can stay isolated from the main working tree.
      </p>

      <ul class="space-y-6 sm:space-y-8">
        <li class="flex gap-3 sm:gap-4">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 sm:w-8 sm:h-8 rounded bg-terminal border border-slate-dark text-white font-mono flex items-center justify-center text-xs sm:text-sm">1</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-white font-bold mb-1 text-sm sm:text-base">Isolated worktrees</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate leading-relaxed">Give each task its own branch and working directory.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3 sm:gap-4">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 sm:w-8 sm:h-8 rounded bg-terminal border border-slate-dark text-white font-mono flex items-center justify-center text-xs sm:text-sm">2</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-white font-bold mb-1 text-sm sm:text-base">Agent-powered fixes</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate leading-relaxed">Start focused coding work without disturbing the main project session.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3 sm:gap-4">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-6 h-6 sm:w-8 sm:h-8 rounded bg-terminal border border-slate-dark text-white font-mono flex items-center justify-center text-xs sm:text-sm">3</div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-white font-bold mb-1 text-sm sm:text-base">Ready to ship</h3>
            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate leading-relaxed">Finish the task, review the result, and create or close the workflow cleanly.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="mt-8 text-slate text-sm italic leading-relaxed">
        Keep the conversation simple. Keep the Git state safe.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-terminal border border-slate-dark rounded-xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl mt-4 lg:mt-0">
      <div class="border-b border-slate-dark bg-night p-3 text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-mono text-slate flex justify-between">
        <span>~/.nightme/gtw.yml</span>
        <span class="text-slate-dark">YAML</span>
      </div>
<pre class="p-4 sm:p-6 text-[10px] sm:text-sm font-mono leading-relaxed overflow-x-auto"><span class="text-slate"># Auto-rehydrate dev environment</span>
<span class="text-slate"># in the newly created worktree</span>
<span class="text-alert">fix:</span>
  <span class="text-cyan-300">hooks:</span>
    <span class="text-tgreen">after:</span>
      <span class="text-warn">-</span> <span class="text-white">codegraph init</span>
      <span class="text-warn">-</span> <span class="text-white">npm install</span>
      <span class="text-warn">-</span> <span class="text-white">go mod download</span></pre>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section id="supported" class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-night border-b border-slate-dark">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="text-center mb-10 sm:mb-12">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-terminal border border-slate-dark text-xs font-mono text-cyber mb-4 uppercase tracking-wider">
        Your agents, not our lock-in
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
        Bring the coding agents you already use.
      </h2>
      <p class="text-slate max-w-3xl mx-auto text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed">
        NightMe does not replace your agent or your model subscription. It gives different local coding agents the same conversation and control layer, so you can switch tools without switching your workflow.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-10">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 font-mono text-sm">
        <span class="bg-terminal border border-slate-dark rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-white">Claude Code</span>
        <span class="text-slate-dark self-center">&middot;</span>
        <span class="bg-terminal border border-slate-dark rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-white">Codex</span>
        <span class="text-slate-dark self-center">&middot;</span>
        <span class="bg-terminal border border-slate-dark rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-white">DSH</span>
        <span class="text-slate-dark self-center">&middot;</span>
        <span class="bg-terminal border border-slate-dark rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-white">GitHub Copilot CLI</span>
        <span class="text-slate-dark self-center">&middot;</span>
        <span class="bg-terminal border border-slate-dark rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-white">Pi</span>
        <span class="text-slate-dark self-center">&middot;</span>
        <span class="bg-terminal border border-slate-dark rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-white">OpenCode</span>
        <span class="text-slate-dark self-center">&middot;</span>
        <span class="bg-terminal border border-slate-dark rounded-lg px-4 py-2 text-white">Cursor</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center text-slate text-sm sm:text-base italic leading-relaxed">
      Use the best agent for the task. Keep the same NightMe workflow.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>


<section id="install" class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-[#0D1017] border-b border-slate-dark">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="text-center mb-10 sm:mb-14">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-terminal border border-slate-dark text-xs font-mono text-cyber mb-4 uppercase tracking-wider">
        Get started
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-6">
        From zero to your first remote coding session.
      </h2>
    </div>

    
    <ol class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4 sm:gap-5 max-w-6xl mx-auto mb-12 sm:mb-16">
      <li class="bg-terminal border border-slate-dark rounded-xl p-5">
        <div class="text-cyber font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold mb-2">Step 1</div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-base mb-2">Install NightMe</h3>
        <p class="text-slate text-xs leading-relaxed">Install the single binary on the machine where your coding agents run.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="bg-terminal border border-slate-dark rounded-xl p-5">
        <div class="text-cyber font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold mb-2">Step 2</div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-base mb-2">Connect your chat</h3>
        <p class="text-slate text-xs leading-relaxed">Sign in to a supported chat platform and connect it to NightMe.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="bg-terminal border border-slate-dark rounded-xl p-5">
        <div class="text-cyber font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold mb-2">Step 3</div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-base mb-2">Choose your agent</h3>
        <p class="text-slate text-xs leading-relaxed">Start the local coding agent that fits the task. Your NightMe workflow stays the same.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="bg-terminal border border-slate-dark rounded-xl p-5">
        <div class="text-cyber font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold mb-2">Step 4</div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-base mb-2">Send your first task</h3>
        <p class="text-slate text-xs leading-relaxed">Ask the agent to work. Leave the desk. Follow the progress from the conversation.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="bg-terminal border border-slate-dark rounded-xl p-5">
        <div class="text-cyber font-mono text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold mb-2">Step 5</div>
        <h3 class="text-white font-bold text-base mb-2">Step in when it matters</h3>
        <p class="text-slate text-xs leading-relaxed">Stop or steer the session when you need to change direction.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>

    
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="border border-slate-dark rounded-lg overflow-hidden bg-night font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm">

        
        <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 px-4 sm:px-6 pt-3 sm:pt-4 border-b border-slate-dark text-slate">

          
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 sm:gap-6 flex-wrap">
            <span class="font-bold text-white">INSTALL</span>
            <button type="button" data-tab="one-liner" data-tab-group="method" class="py-2 border-b-2 border-cyber text-cyber font-medium transition-colors">One-liner</button>
            <button type="button" data-tab="binary" data-tab-group="method" class="py-2 border-b-2 border-transparent hover:text-white transition-colors">Binary</button>
            <button type="button" data-tab="source" data-tab-group="method" class="py-2 border-b-2 border-transparent hover:text-white transition-colors">Source</button>
          </div>

          
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 sm:gap-6 flex-wrap ml-auto">
            <button type="button" data-tab="mac" data-tab-group="os" class="py-2 border-b-2 border-cyber text-cyber font-medium transition-colors">macOS &amp; Linux</button>
            <button type="button" data-tab="win" data-tab-group="os" class="py-2 border-b-2 border-transparent hover:text-white transition-colors">Windows</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        
        <div class="px-4 sm:px-6 py-5 sm:py-6 text-slate-300 space-y-3">

          
          <div data-tab-panel="one-liner" data-tab-group="method">
            <div data-tab-panel="mac" data-tab-group="os">
              <p class="italic text-slate-dark"># One line. Installs everything. You're welcome. 🌙</p>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 mt-1">
                <code class="whitespace-nowrap overflow-x-auto select-all"><span class="text-tgreen">$</span> curl -fsSL https://nightme.dev/install.sh | bash</code>
                <button type="button" data-copy-target="code-one-liner-mac" class="text-slate-dark hover:text-white transition-colors shrink-0" aria-label="Copy command">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2m-6 12h8a2 2 0 002-2v-8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-8a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
                </button>
              </div>
              <code id="code-one-liner-mac" class="hidden">curl -fsSL https://nightme.dev/install.sh | bash</code>
            </div>
            <div data-tab-panel="win" data-tab-group="os" class="hidden">
              <p class="italic text-slate-dark"># One line. Installs everything. You're welcome. 🌙</p>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 mt-1">
                <code class="whitespace-nowrap overflow-x-auto select-all"><span class="text-tgreen">$</span> powershell -c "irm https://nightme.dev/install.ps1 | iex"</code>
                <button type="button" data-copy-target="code-one-liner-win" class="text-slate-dark hover:text-white transition-colors shrink-0" aria-label="Copy command">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2m-6 12h8a2 2 0 002-2v-8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-8a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
                </button>
              </div>
              <code id="code-one-liner-win" class="hidden">powershell -c "irm https://nightme.dev/install.ps1 | iex"</code>
            </div>
          </div>

          
          <div data-tab-panel="binary" data-tab-group="method" class="hidden">
            <div data-tab-panel="mac" data-tab-group="os">
              <p class="italic text-slate-dark"># Pick the asset for your OS + arch from the releases page.</p>
              <p class="mt-1"><span class="text-cyber">→</span> <a href="https://github.com/cnlangzi/nightme/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-cyber hover:underline break-all">github.com/cnlangzi/nightme/releases</a></p>
            </div>
            <div data-tab-panel="win" data-tab-group="os" class="hidden">
              <p class="italic text-slate-dark"># Pick the <span class="text-cyber not-italic">.exe</span> for your arch from the releases page.</p>
              <p class="mt-1"><span class="text-cyber">→</span> <a href="https://github.com/cnlangzi/nightme/releases" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-cyber hover:underline break-all">github.com/cnlangzi/nightme/releases</a></p>
            </div>
          </div>

          
          <div data-tab-panel="source" data-tab-group="method" class="hidden">
            <div data-tab-panel="mac" data-tab-group="os">
              <p class="italic text-slate-dark"># Build from source. <span class="text-cyber not-italic">make dev</span> runs from source with example config — no separate build step.</p>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 mt-1">
                <code class="whitespace-pre overflow-x-auto select-all"><span class="text-tgreen">$</span> git clone https://github.com/cnlangzi/nightme.git
<span class="text-tgreen">$</span> cd nightme &amp;&amp; make dev</code>
                <button type="button" data-copy-target="code-source-mac" class="text-slate-dark hover:text-white transition-colors shrink-0" aria-label="Copy command">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M8 16H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6a2 2 0 012-2h8a2 2 0 012 2v2m-6 12h8a2 2 0 002-2v-8a2 2 0 00-2-2h-8a2 2 0 00-2 2v8a2 2 0 002 2z"></path></svg>
                </button>
              </div>
              <code id="code-source-mac" class="hidden">git clone https://github.com/cnlangzi/nightme.git
cd nightme &amp;&amp; make dev</code>
            </div>
            <div data-tab-panel="win" data-tab-group="os" class="hidden">
              <p class="italic text-slate-dark"># Build from source. Run inside <span class="text-cyber not-italic">Git Bash</span> or WSL.</p>
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 mt-1">
                <code class="whitespace-pre overflow-x-auto select-all"><span class="text-tgreen">$</span> git clone https://github.com/cnlangzi/nightme.git
<span class="text-tgreen">$</span> cd nightme; make dev</code>
                <button type="button" data-copy-target="code-source-win" class="text-slate-dark hover:text-white transition-colors shrink-0" aria-label="Copy command">
